  "remarks": "Anton Anisimov is a prominent figure in Russia’s state-controlled international media. He is the Deputy Editor-in-Chief of Russia Today, the Head of International Broadcasting of Sputnik News Agency and Radio, and the Editor-in-Chief of Sputnik News Agency and Radio. In his roles at Sputnik and Russia Today, Anton Anisimov is responsible for spreading disinformation related to Ukraine and promoting false pro-Kremlin narratives about Russia’s invasion of Ukraine.",
